  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Do you yawn?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "There are about 20 reasons that scientists think are possible for yawning after research.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "They do not know exactly why yawning happens, but they do know many facts about yawning.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Everyone yawns in the same way, from babies to adults.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "First you open your mouth slowly, like a sleepy lion.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Your mouth stays open for about 5 seconds.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "You take in a lot of air and then push it out.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Then you quickly close your mouth.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Yawning is contagious.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "If you see someone yawn, your body may reply by yawning too.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Much like a secret way of communication.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Many people say they yawn because they are tired.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "That might be true.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "People do often yawn before they sleep and after they wake up or before breakfast.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "However, people also yawn when they are excited or nervous.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Yawning doesn't just mean you are lazy.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Yawning proves that your body needs to stay alert.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "When you yawn, you breathe deeply.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "You also stretch the muscles in your face, throat, neck, and shoulders.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "Your eardrums stretch too.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Maybe this helps you to be quicker to notice things.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-21.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "In some countries, people think yawning is not nice.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-22.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "People put their hands over their mouths to cover a yawn.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-23.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "And we often do the same thing when we cough.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-24.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "However, in other countries, people think yawning can let good things in.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-25.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "Scientists do not spend much time studying yawning.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-26.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "That is probably because yawning does not hurt or cause any medical emergency.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-27.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "It is just a normal thing we do.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-28.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
